{"@context":"http://iiif.io/api/presentation/2/context.json","@id":"https://api.cultural.jp/iiif/2/exhibition","@type":"sc:Collection","label":"カルチュラルジャパン展覧会アーカイブ","description":"各館が開催した展覧会の基本情報および出展アイテムをRDF化した情報のアーカイブ","collections":[{"@id":"https://api.cultural.jp/iiif/2/exhibition/apmoa-exhib-2021-soga","@type":"sc:Collection","label":"奇想ここに極まれり｜曽我蕭白展","description":[{"@value":"力強い筆墨と極彩色で超現実的な世界を描き出した蕭白のあくの強い画面は、グロテスクでありながらおかしみもたたえ、見る人をひきつけて止みません。本展では、強烈な印象を与える蕭白の醜怪な表現を紹介すると共に、その原点となった桃山時代の絵画、そして江戸時代初期の絵画との関係を掘り下げることで、蕭白がいかにして型を破り、奇矯な画風を打ち立てたのかを明らかにし、また晩年の作品への変化を通して画業の到達点を見定めます。。（ジャパンサーチ愛知県美術館ギャラリーから）"}],"seeAlso":"https://ld.cultural.jp/data/apmoa-exhib-2021-soga","related":"https://static.chunichi.co.jp/chunichi/pages/event/soga_shohaku/","metadata":[{"property":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/term/property#accessInfo","label":"Access","value":"愛知県美術館","id":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/entity/chname/愛知県美術館"},{"property":"http://schema.org/temporal","label":"Temporal Label","value":"2021年","id":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/entity/time/2021"},{"property":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/term/property#temporal","label":"JPS Temporal","value":"2021-10-08/2021-11-21"},{"property":"http://schema.org/workFeatured","label":"Count of Work Featured","value":28}]},{"@id":"https://api.cultural.jp/iiif/2/exhibition/britishm-exhib-2022-hokusai","@type":"sc:Collection","label":"大英博物館 北斎―国内の肉筆画の名品とともに―","description":[{"@value":"This exhibition displays approximately 110 works selected from the British Museum’s collection of over 800 pieces, together with masterpieces of painting from collections in Japan. By tracing the transition of Hokusai’s artistic career over a period of 70 years, it focuses particularly on the 30 years from his 60th birthday until his death at the age of 90, when many of his most famous works were produced.","@language":"en"},{"@value":"大英博物館には、複数のコレクターから入手した北斎の優品が多数収蔵されており、そのコレクションの質は世界でもトップクラスです。本展では、この大英博物館が所蔵する北斎作品を中心に、国内の肉筆画の名品とともに、北斎の画業の変遷を追います。約70年におよぶ北斎の作画活動のなかでも、とくに還暦を迎えた60歳から、90歳で亡くなるまでの30年間に焦点を当て、数多くの代表作が生み出されていく様子をご紹介します。また、大英博物館に北斎作品を納めたコレクターたちにも注目し、彼らの日本美術愛好の様相を浮き彫りにします。（公式サイトから）","@language":"ja"}],"seeAlso":"https://ld.cultural.jp/data/britishm-exhib-2022-hokusai","metadata":[{"property":"http://schema.org/spatial","label":"Spatial Label","value":"東京都","id":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/entity/place/東京"},{"property":"http://schema.org/temporal","label":"Temporal Label","value":"2022年","id":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/entity/time/2022"},{"property":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/term/property#temporal","label":"JPS Temporal","value":"2022-04-16/2022-06-12"},{"property":"http://schema.org/workFeatured","label":"Count of Work Featured","value":99}]},{"@id":"https://api.cultural.jp/iiif/2/exhibition/britishm-exhib-2026-tobi","@type":"sc:Collection","label":"大英博物館日本美術コレクション　百花繚乱～海を越えた江戸絵画","description":[{"@value":"This exhibition will showcase selected masterpieces from the British Museum’s some 40,000-piece Japanese collection with a focus on Edo-period paintings on folding screens (byobu), hanging scrolls (kakejiku), and handscrolls (emaki), as well as prints by eight renowned ukiyo-e artists including Utamaro, Sharaku, Hokusai, and Hiroshige. By also shedding light on recent research findings and the collection’s history, the exhibition will trace the British Museum’s role at the forefront of the collection, research, and conservation of Japanese art. It will, in this way, present opportunities to look back on the history of international cultural exchange and, at the same time, open a new dialogue between we who live today and Japanese art masterpieces in the care of the British Museum.","@language":"en"},{"@value":"本展では、4万点に及ぶ同館の日本コレクションから、江戸時代の屏風、掛軸、絵巻の絵画作品と、歌麿、写楽、北斎、広重など代表的な8人の浮世絵師による版画を中心に、優れた作品を厳選してご紹介いたします。さらに、近年の調査成果や収集の背景にも光をあてることで同館が日本美術の収集・研究・保存の第一線で果たしてきた役割をたどります。それは、国際的な文化交流の歴史を振り返ると同時に、大英博物館に受け継がれてきた日本美術の名品と、今日を生きる私たちとのあいだに新たな対話をひらく機会ともなるでしょう。（公式サイトから）","@language":"ja"}],"seeAlso":"https://ld.cultural.jp/data/britishm-exhib-2026-tobi","metadata":[{"property":"http://schema.org/spatial","label":"Spatial Label","value":"東京都","id":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/entity/place/東京"},{"property":"http://schema.org/temporal","label":"Temporal Label","value":"2026年","id":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/entity/time/2026"},{"property":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/term/property#temporal","label":"JPS Temporal","value":"2026-07-25/10-18"},{"property":"http://schema.org/workFeatured","label":"Count of Work Featured","value":192}]},{"@id":"https://api.cultural.jp/iiif/2/exhibition/cleveland-exhib-16c-japan-1991","@type":"sc:Collection","label":"The Triumph of Japanese Style: 16th Century Art in Japan","seeAlso":"https://ld.cultural.jp/data/cleveland-exhib-16c-japan-1991","metadata":[{"property":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/term/property#accessInfo","label":"Access","value":"クリーブランド美術館","id":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/entity/chname/クリーブランド美術館"},{"property":"http://schema.org/spatial","label":"Spatial Label","value":"アメリカ","id":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/entity/place/アメリカ"},{"property":"http://schema.org/temporal","label":"Temporal Label","value":"1991年","id":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/entity/time/1991"},{"property":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/term/property#temporal","label":"JPS Temporal","value":"October 19-December 1, 1991"},{"property":"http://schema.org/workFeatured","label":"Count of Work Featured","value":22}]},{"@id":"https://api.cultural.jp/iiif/2/exhibition/cleveland-exhib-20th-anniv-1936","@type":"sc:Collection","label":"The Twentieth Anniversary Exhibition: The Official Art Exhibit of the Great Lakes Exposition","seeAlso":"https://ld.cultural.jp/data/cleveland-exhib-20th-anniv-1936","metadata":[{"property":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/term/property#accessInfo","label":"Access","value":"クリーブランド美術館","id":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/entity/chname/クリーブランド美術館"},{"property":"http://schema.org/spatial","label":"Spatial Label","value":"アメリカ","id":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/entity/place/アメリカ"},{"property":"http://schema.org/temporal","label":"Temporal 